# symbolic SATO template
# family: CrossOver (label-type-code=6) / 2x7.25 / ref-first
# ported field-for-field from c:\Workspace\southalr\t0sz2x725-co-aut-reffirst.i (auto/PLC
# path, dispatched from dtplc067.p's ih-label-type-code=6 branch when the line's configured
# include for this size is "dtlbl060d.i").
#
# Simplifications (documented, not oversights):
# - No setsato table equivalent (same accepted gap as the rest of this port) -- heat/speed
#   hardcoded to the .i file's own defaults (#F5/CS6) rather than looked up per terminal/
#   line/model.
# - prt-co-desc-us/fr/sp and prt-shape-co-desc/prt-shape-co-d are sourced in Progress from a
#   SAP-fed sapitemhdr buffer specific to CrossOver items (see dtlbl007n.i) -- this port has
#   no sapitemhdr equivalent, so they're approximated with the regular itemdet-sourced
#   ColorDesc/ColorDescFrench/ColorDescSpanish/ShapeDesc fields. Both prt-shape-co-desc and
#   prt-shape-co-d map to the same ShapeDesc below, since no second shape field exists here.
# - The legacy source's trailing "~A0" (right before the final Q/Z) doesn't match any
#   documented SBPL escape -- reproduced verbatim as literal text rather than guessed at.

